This is it.

262
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:55,600
I can cut him.

263
00:22:01,900 --> 00:22:02,780
Burnt it!

264
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:26,040
See, you figured out my trick.

265
00:22:27,040 --> 00:22:28,980
That's very clever of you.

266
00:22:29,520 --> 00:22:30,940
You're damn right I did.

267
00:22:31,380 --> 00:22:34,240
Now nothing can stop me from beating you.

268
00:22:37,060 --> 00:22:37,890
Fire!

269
00:22:53,420 --> 00:22:54,250
Ultra!

270
00:22:56,140 --> 00:22:57,140
Tiger trap!

271
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,784
Why are you trying to block me?

272
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:17,685
I thought you were invincible!

273
00:23:18,180 --> 00:23:21,360
Or are you scared what
might attack my duty?

274
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:27,120
Oh, my God.

275
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:10,520
You are biologically
incapable of defeating me!

276
00:24:12,500 --> 00:24:14,940
Blaming biologists is a weak excuse.

277
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:17,184
I won't limit myself like that.

278
00:24:17,740 --> 00:24:22,420
I shall remember you for your brave
resorts, or your arrogance, I should say.

279
00:24:23,500 --> 00:24:25,735
I'll carve it into your memory myself!

280
00:24:26,020 --> 00:24:28,740
Do I seriously have
you lived through this?

281
00:24:34,500 --> 00:24:36,540
Imperial Bellamy Frames!

282
00:24:47,060 --> 00:24:47,890
Let's go.

283
00:25:17,420 --> 00:25:20,780
King of Hell, Three-Sword Serpents!

284
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:27,200
One hundred and three mercies!

285
00:25:31,060 --> 00:25:34,500
This is the end for you, Rolodawa!

286
00:25:39,580 --> 00:25:41,260
Dragon, damnation!

287
00:26:13,860 --> 00:26:16,697
Ah, Kaido... I don't...

288
00:26:16,780 --> 00:26:18,277
I...

289
00:26:18,360 --> 00:26:21,007
Are you still holding
on to that, Dream King?

290
00:26:22,060 --> 00:26:23,820
You really think I'm Joy Boy?

291
00:26:24,300 --> 00:26:25,957
I mean, I'm not complaining here.

292
00:26:26,040 --> 00:26:30,275
But are you sure the world I'm looking
to make is the one that you want?

293
00:26:31,540 --> 00:26:33,422
Well, a legend is just a legend.

294
00:26:33,860 --> 00:26:36,919
And I could never ask for
more than you've given me.

295
00:26:37,580 --> 00:26:39,051
I'm alive because of you.

296
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:41,280
My life is yours.

297
00:26:42,020 --> 00:26:43,837
So you must remain undefeated.

298
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:46,560
and I will do the same.

299
00:26:48,340 --> 00:26:51,000
You will be king of the pirates.

300
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:07,080
I know that you need nothing less than
the greatest swordsman in the world.

301
00:27:17,820 --> 00:27:22,917
so until the day comes when i defeat
him and take his title i promise

302
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:26,117
you that i will never lose again

303
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:30,880
is that okay king of the pirates

304
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:37,257
I will become

305
00:27:37,340 --> 00:27:43,900
the king of hell.

306
00:27:58,760 --> 00:28:04,780
The battle of the Ritebring Tower outside
the Skull Dome has come to an end.

307
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:13,380
The winner, Zoro.

308
00:28:13,900 --> 00:28:15,400
Thank you.
